    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>五一想出行怎么办，本来以为当了大聪明，结果真香了！</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>锣鼓喧天鞭炮齐鸣，欢迎各路神仙加入我们的听友群！</span></p><p><span>群里会有二叔和不困全天候陪大家哔哔哔，也会有之前请过的嘉宾们和大家实时互动！</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>另外，群里也欢迎大家投稿，说出你的故事，或者你的困扰，大家一起帮你想办法，或者大家置换一些瓜，快乐摸鱼你我他。</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>希望大家积极加小助手（其实就是二叔）进群哦～～</span></p><p></p><img src="https://uploader.shimo.im/f/dcMbAxFk3Iti8moO.JPG!thumbnail?accessToken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6ImRlZmF1bHQiLCJ0eXAiOiJKV1QifQ.eyJleHAiOjE3Nzc5OTg2ODksImZpbGVHVUlEIjoiRWd1emFpVVFiMWpyMFBaTiIsImlhdCI6MTc3Nzk5ODM4OSwiaXNzIjoidXBsb2FkZXJfYWNjZXNzX3Jlc291cmNlIiwicGFhIjoiYWxsOmFsbDoiLCJ1c2VySWQiOjI4NTU2MjAzfQ.P0qeceIcy_AdPVySxfmT2J-KwFJW3ukHZjZh7jZmJlI"><p><span>绿色气泡是回家的路：lielielieradio&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="310">05:10</a> 二叔血糖爆表变“甜甜二叔”，空腹血糖13.9，被医院扣下狂输十斤液！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> 五一前一天极限决策！凌晨两点自驾冲大同，避开堵车爽翻啦</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1470">24:30</a></span></strong><strong><span> 大同气温离谱到炸！0℃→25℃随机切换，裙子里套秋裤笑不活了</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">33:10</a> 云冈石窟早冲封神！6点半入园不用排队，晚来直接排50分钟大队</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2690">44:50</a> 山西菜酸到灵魂出窍！沙棘果汁一口酸哭，糖醋里脊全是醋没糖</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3330">55:30</a></span></strong><strong><span> 踩雷快捷酒店！前台消失、浴室有假睫毛，服务态度差到离谱</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4215">70:15</a> 大同碳水天堂！莜面窝窝、黄米凉糕，主食菜单比菜还厚</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5320">88:40</a></span></strong><strong><span> 应县木塔震撼到失语！全木榫卯千年不倒，周边却像农村大集</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5900">98:20</a></span></strong><strong><span> 299元唐风妆造超绝！手绘花钿超精致，就是再化下去拍照排不上了！！</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7205">120:05</a> 99元钟点房逆袭天堂！全屋智能+大牌洗护，对比前酒店哭了</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>山西大同，文旅局上大分！！！</span></p>]]></description>
